<title>USA: AMR sues Northwest for trying to stop study.</title>
<headline>AMR sues Northwest for trying to stop study.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMR Corp's American Airlines said on Thursday that it was suing Northwest Airlines Corp for allegedly trying to stop a consulting firm from doing a study on American's proposed alliance with British Airways Plc.</p>
</text>
